{"rank": 169, "root": "سبق", "form": 1, "lemma": "سَبَقَ", "count": 20, "ayahCount": 20, "share": 0.1, "meaning": {"bs": "preteći, prethoditi", "en": "to precede, to outrun", "tr": "geçmek, öne geçmek", "fr": "devancer, précéder", "id": "mendahului", "ur": "آگے بڑھنا، سبقت کرنا", "bn": "অগ্রগামী হওয়া, ছাড়িয়ে যাওয়া", "fa": "پیشی گرفتن، سبقت گرفتن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/76f1db9aeccf158b635b.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-sabaqa_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes sabaqa_1-s{from{transform:rotate(-50deg)}}@keyframes sabaqa_1-t{from{transform:rotate(50deg)}}.va-sabaqa_1 .ll,.va-sabaqa_1 .ra{transform:rotate(50deg);animation:sabaqa_1-s .25s ease-in-out 9 alternate both}.va-sabaqa_1 .rl,.va-sabaqa_1 .la{transform:rotate(-50deg);animation:sabaqa_1-t .25s ease-in-out 9 alternate both}@keyframes sabaqa_1-m{from{transform:translateX(-78px)}}@keyframes sabaqa_1-n{from{transform:translateX(-52px)}}.va-sabaqa_1 .a .fig{animation:sabaqa_1-m 2.25s ease-out both}.va-sabaqa_1 .b .fig{animation:sabaqa_1-n 2.25s ease-out both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-sabaqa_1.off,.va-sabaqa_1.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-sabaqa_1,.va-sabaqa_1 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><path class=\"p\" d=\"M108 61V28M108 29h8l-2 4 2 4h-8\"/><g class=\"b\"><g transform=\"translate(72 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></g><g